msgctxt "Training Status field description"
msgid ""
"This contact is currently on hold. It has potential of getting scheduled in "
"the future."
msgstr ""
"Dit contact staat momenteel in de wacht. Het heeft de potentie om in de "
"toekomst gepland te worden."

