msgid ""
"A related training that isn't a parent/child in relationship. It might "
"indicate trainings that collaborate, are about to merge, recently split, etc."
msgstr ""
"Een gerelateerde training die geen ouder / kind in relatie is. Het kan "
"duiden op trainingen die samenwerken, op het punt staan samen te gaan, "
"onlangs opgesplitst, enz."

